# What stays out of the install zip (`make zip-package`, and GitHub's own source zips for
# a tag: both honour export-ignore). Development machinery only; the tests stay in, so
# `make check` works from an unzipped install, and so do the user-facing docs.
.github/            export-ignore
.claude/            export-ignore
.gitattributes      export-ignore
docs/planning/      export-ignore
docs/archived/      export-ignore
sandbox/            export-ignore
